2. ERA5 data — meteo/kefa_atmos_data.csv, meteo/kefa_wave_data.csv
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:         ERA5 reanalysis (Hersbach, H., et al., 2020, The ERA5 global
                reanalysis, Q. J. R. Meteorol. Soc., 146, 1999-2049,
                https://doi.org/10.1002/qj.3803), produced by the European
                Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF) for the
                Copernicus Climate Change Service (C3S) and obtained from the
                Copernicus Climate Data Store (CDS).
Processing:     hourly point extraction at the grid point nearest to 38.5 N,
                20.5 E, 2024-04-24 to 2024-06-22; wind speed and direction
                derived from the 10 m u/v components (see meteo/README.md).
